      "act": "PROBLEM",
      "role_note": "two real kinds of agent",
      "narration_text": "Method: the market splits into two real categories. Assistive agents surface insights and suggest next steps, but wait for a human to approve before acting. Autonomous agents complete a workflow on their own, inside guardrails — expense approvals, vendor payments, compliance checks — without someone in the loop for every step.",
